## 💜 About

**Lavender Purple Theme** is a collection of soft and aesthetic purple themes made for **Visual Studio Code**.

It is designed for developers who enjoy a cozy, clean and relaxing coding environment with beautiful lavender and purple colors.

Whether you prefer a deep dark editor or a gentle light interface, Lavender Purple Theme has something for you. 💜

---

## 🎨 Available Themes

| Theme | Mode | Style |
|---|---|---|
| 🌌 **Lavender Theme Dark 1** | Dark | Deep & Cozy |
| 🌙 **Lavender Theme Dark 2** | Dark | Soft & Dreamy |
| ☁️ **Lavender Theme Light** | Light | Clean & Gentle |

---

## ✨ Features

- 💜 Soft lavender and purple color palette
- 🌌 Two beautiful dark themes
- ☁️ One clean light theme
- 🎀 Cozy and aesthetic design
- 👨‍💻 Designed for Visual Studio Code
- 🖥️ Comfortable for everyday coding
- 🌙 Purple-focused editor experience
- 🪻 Simple and relaxing interface

